dhp59:2 starts: people run-of-the-mill & blind,
dhp59:3 starts: there dazzles with discernment the disciple
dhp59:4 starts: the disciple of the Rightly Self-Awakened One.
dhp86:3 starts: will cross over the realm of Death
dhp86:4 starts: the realm of Death so hard to transcend.
thag1.25:1.1 starts: Like splendor, his mind, continually fruitful:
thag1.25:1.3 starts: Attack a monk like that,
sn35.95:10.2 starts: When for you there will be only the seen
